# Section placement

When adding a new BYQ or custom section to the homepage:

1. Create the component under `components/sections/`.
2. Import it in `app/page.tsx`.
3. Render it **last** in `<main>` — after all existing sections (footer lives in `app/layout.tsx`).
4. Only place it elsewhere if the user explicitly specifies a position (e.g. "after the hero", "before pricing").

# Sparkles styling

This site uses the **Sparkles** design system only:

- Colors: `sparkles-cream`, `sparkles-navy`, `sparkles-warm`, `sparkles-blue`, `sparkles-accent` (see `app/globals.css`)
- Fonts: `font-display` (Decalotype Fix) for headings/buttons, `font-body` (Bricolage Grotesque) for body/labels
- Container: `max-w-[1800px] mx-auto px-8 max-[767px]:px-4`
- Do not use Evermind or other template color palettes

Example — default (append):

```tsx
<main className="bg-sparkles-cream">
  <HeroSection />
  {/* ...existing sections... */}
  <NewSection />
</main>
```
